<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<body style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; color: #333;">
    <h2 style="text-align:center;">DORY PH, INC.<br />Notice of Service Area Removal</h2>

    <p>Dear {{name}},</p>

    <p>
        Pursuant to the Non-Activity of Partner Operations Policy stated under
        Memorandum No. 2025.10.033, partners are required to complete a minimum
        of ten (10) delivery transactions per month in each of their assigned
        service areas.
    </p>

    <p>
        Our records show that the service area(s) listed below continued to
        record fewer than ten (10) delivered transactions in a month, despite
        the notice(s) previously sent to you, and have therefore been removed
        from your partnership account:
    </p>

    <ul>
        {{#each areas}}
        <li><strong>{{this}}</strong></li>
        {{/each}}
    </ul>

    <p>
        Orders from the removed area(s) will no longer be assigned to your
        account.
    </p>

    <p>
        <strong>Your account remains active</strong> for your other assigned
        service areas. Please continue to meet the minimum activity requirement
        in those areas to keep them active.
    </p>

    <p>
        If you have questions about this notice, please reply to this email.
    </p>

    <br />
    <p>--<br />
        Regards,<br />
        <strong>Admin. Assistant</strong><br />
        Dory Ph, Inc.
    </p>
</body>

</html>
